## SQ-WT-02 | Wares delivery agreements in the common pool 16 times
@group any
@commands `/dumptrades`; count `wares:sealed_delivery_agreement` listings in `wandering_trader.pool_1` of `kubejs/exported/villager_trades.json`
@pass 16 agreement listings in pool_1 (8 per price), none in pool_2; pool_1 about 196 entries
@fails `t.move` weight in `kubejs/server_scripts/economy/wandering_trades.js` (Wares section); a stale dump (dump time)
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> dumptrades
sleep 5
shell python3 -c "import json,sys;d=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/villager_trades.json'))['wandering_trader'];n1=json.dumps(d['pool_1']).count('sealed_delivery_agreement');n2=json.dumps(d['pool_2']).count('sealed_delivery_agreement');print('pool_1',len(d['pool_1']),'agreements',n1,'pool_2 agreements',n2);sys.exit(0 if n1==16 and n2==0 else 1)"
look the shell line: agreements 16 in pool_1, 0 in pool_2

@@section 2
@@title SQ-WT wave 2 carve: Wandering Trader spawn and offers moved to Creative Loot, config carry-over, 2026-11-24 ([wandering_trader.md](../wandering_trader.md); [plan_wave2_publish.md](../plan_wave2_publish.md) W2-2, W2-8; TODO `creative-common-publish #19`)
@@date 2026-11-24
@@jars creativecommon creativeloot
@@sources feature_writeup/wandering_trader.md development/creativeLoot/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativeloot/CreativeLoot.java development/creativeLoot/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativeloot/LootConfig.java development/creativeLoot/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativeloot/trader/WanderingTraderTweaks.java
@@prep copy tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/old_common_bees_trader.toml config/creativecommon-common.toml
@@prep rm config/creativeloot-common.toml
@@text `[wandering_trader]` lives in `config/creativeloot-common.toml` (Creative Loot's first config file) since 2026-11-24, with `WanderingTraderSpawnerMixin` and `WanderingTraderTradesMixin`; Trade Sync and the trade helper stay in Common. Loot's constructor copies an old `[wandering_trader]` from `creativecommon-common.toml` once. Fixture: `tools/scratch_query/fixtures/wave2_carry/old_common_bees_trader.toml`.
@@table
## SQ-WT-03 | carry-over: Common's [wandering_trader] becomes Loot's new config file
@group A (full pack, fixture toml)
@commands before boot put `old_common_bees_trader.toml` as `config/creativecommon-common.toml`, no `creativeloot-common.toml`; boot; read both files and the log
@pass `config/creativeloot-common.toml` has `[wandering_trader]` enabled = true, traderIntervalTicks = 48000, commonTrades = 12, rareTrades = 3; Common's file has no `[wandering_trader]` after the boot; latest.log has `[swaps] config sections [wandering_trader] carried over from creativecommon-common.toml to creativeloot-common.toml`
@fails the carry in `CreativeLoot` constructor (before `registerConfig`); Common still declaring the section
@modset none
bootexpect \[swaps\] config sections \[wandering_trader\] carried over from creativecommon-common\.toml to creativeloot-common\.toml
bootreject \[swaps\] could not (carry|merge) config sections .*wandering_trader
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*enabled = true\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*traderIntervalTicks = 48000\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*commonTrades = 12\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*rareTrades = 3\s*$'
shell ! grep -n '^\[wandering_trader\]' config/creativecommon-common.toml
## SQ-WT-04 | trader offer counts and spawn wait read from Loot's config; vanilla defaults without the pack values
@group A
@commands full pack: `/summon minecraft:wandering_trader ~ ~ ~`; `/data get entity @e[type=minecraft:wandering_trader,limit=1,sort=nearest] Offers.Recipes` and count; then `qrun.py toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader enabled false`, restart, summon a second trader and count; then switch to `loot_alone` (Creative Loot with only Common, Compat and LootJS, empty config: Loot needs Compat and LootJS, so `cc_only alone` plus Loot cannot boot) and read the generated `config/creativeloot-common.toml`
@pass pack values: about 25 common + 5 rare offers (fewer only when a pool is smaller); enabled false: 5 + 1; the generated file has enabled = false, 24000 / 5 / 1; latest.log has no mixin apply error naming `WanderingTrader`
@fails `creativeloot.mixins.json` missing the two mixins; `LootConfig` not registered; Common's old mixins still listed in `creativecommon.mixins.json` (double apply)
@reviewed 2026-11-24
@modset none
edit python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py" toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader enabled true && python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py" toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader traderIntervalTicks 96000 && python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py" toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader commonTrades 25 && python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py" toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader rareTrades 5
restart
bootreject (?i)(WanderingTrader(Spawner|Trades)Mixin|mixin.*WanderingTrader).*(error|fail|exception|could not)
> forceload add 0 0 15 15
> scoreboard objectives add wt4 dummy
> summon minecraft:wandering_trader 4 -60 4 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["wt4a"]}
sleep 1
> execute store result score #a wt4 run data get entity @e[tag=wt4a,limit=1] Offers.Recipes
> scoreboard players get #a wt4
expect #a has 30 \[wt4\]
edit python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qrun.py" toml config/creativeloot-common.toml wandering_trader enabled false
restart
> forceload add 0 0 15 15
> summon minecraft:wandering_trader 8 -60 8 {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["wt4b"]}
sleep 1
> execute store result score #b wt4 run data get entity @e[tag=wt4b,limit=1] Offers.Recipes
> scoreboard players get #b wt4
expect #b has 6 \[wt4\]
> kill @e[tag=wt4a]
> kill @e[tag=wt4b]
> scoreboard objectives remove wt4
edit python3 "$INST/tools/scratch_query/qmodset.py" switch "$OUT" loot_alone
restart
bootreject (?i)(WanderingTrader(Spawner|Trades)Mixin|mixin.*WanderingTrader).*(error|fail|exception|could not)
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*enabled = false\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*traderIntervalTicks = 24000\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*commonTrades = 5\s*$'
shell awk '/^\[wandering_trader\]/{f=1;next} /^\[/{f=0} f' config/creativeloot-common.toml | grep -E '^\s*rareTrades = 1\s*$'
shell ls mods | grep -ciE '^creative(delight|worldgen|brewing|engineering)-' | grep -qx 0
